      "verdict": "refuted",
      "fact": "WaitingRetry 不是 PushConsumer 和 SimpleConsumer 共有的状态；该状态为 PushConsumer 特有。SimpleConsumer 状态机包含 Ready、Inflight、Commit 和 DLQ，未包含 WaitingRetry。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "rocketmq",
